---
/** Surface: the ladder. The stage is the tray; a sheet stands on it with a well cut in, and a floating sheet passes over. */
---

<span style="position:relative; width:200px; height:124px">
  <span class="cover-sheet cover-stack" style="position:absolute; bottom:0; left:0; width:156px; padding:16px; --gap:14px">
    <span class="cover-stack">
      <i class="cover-bar cover-bar-strong" style="width:48px"></i>
      <i class="cover-bar" style="width:80px"></i>
    </span>
    <span class="cover-well" style="height:36px"></span>
  </span>
  <span class="cover-float cover-stack" style="position:absolute; top:0; right:0; width:88px; padding:14px">
    <i class="cover-bar cover-bar-strong" style="width:32px"></i>
    <i class="cover-bar" style="width:56px"></i>
  </span>
</span>
